# Faithful Mending (CR 119.3, 121.1, 701.9): Bot1 gains exactly 2 life, draws two cards, then discards two. The two cards
# the spell draws are Memnite and Ornithopter, and those are the two the discard offers: if the discard came before the
# draw they would not be in the hand to choose, so this pins "then" too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Island
Faithful Mending
Mountain
Forest
Swamp
Grizzly Bears
Memnite
Ornithopter
Plains x6
Island x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithful Mending.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Choose(Memnite; Ornithopter)

[Expect]
? Bot1.Life = 22
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
